.TH SDL_HasMouse 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_HasMouse \- Return whether a mouse is currently connected.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_mouse.h>
.PP
.BI "bool SDL_HasMouse(void);
.fi
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns true if a mouse is connected, false otherwise\[char46]

.SH THREAD SAFETY
This function should only be called on the main thread\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This function is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

